# Cloudflare serves this repo as the web root (wrangler.jsonc -> assets.directory ".").
# Everything not listed here is downloadable by anyone, so anything in the repo that
# is not part of the website has to be named below.
#
# This file exists because it wasn't: /data/roster.txt was serving 343 brothers'
# names and pledge classes to anyone who asked, while the site itself hides that
# same roster behind sign-in and shows anonymous visitors a demo tree with fake
# names. The database migrations were public too, RLS policies and all.
#
# Adding a folder to this repo? Assume it is PUBLIC until you add it here.

# Brother data. Never public — this is the whole point of the members' area.
data/

# Database: schema, every migration, and the edge-function sources. Publishing
# these hands out the table layout and every RLS policy as free reconnaissance.
supabase/

# Internal notes, planning docs and tooling — not part of the site.
docs/
tools/
*.md

# Repo plumbing.
.gitignore
.gitattributes
wrangler.jsonc
package.json
package-lock.json
node_modules/
